# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shared / universal non-secrets (tracked). Same for every clone.
# Local-specific values: copy `.env.local.example` → `.env.local` and fill placeholders.
# Prod / Preview / CI: set the same names in Vercel or GitHub Actions (they override).
# Secrets stay in `.secret` (see `.secret.example`) — never here.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# No environment-specific KEY=value pairs belong here (no Convex URL, WorkOS client,
# or host URLs). Add only defaults that are truly identical across local, CI, Preview,
# and Production. Today there are none; keep this file as the contract for that split.
